    "m_Title": "Lerp (Important)",
    "m_Content": "what we are doing here is, we recive two color, A and B, and T, the amount of this values to use\n\nso A is the bar, B is the frame and T is the frame Alpha, what it is doing is \"where the frame exists, show it, where it isnt, show the bar\"",
